10. SIMPLE LOADING MESSAGE
================================================================================

Use conditional rendering:

{isLoading && (
  <p>Loading books...</p>
)}


Explanation:

- && is used for conditional rendering.
- If isLoading is true, the message appears.
- If isLoading is false, nothing is rendered.


Conceptually:

isLoading === true

-> Show Loading


isLoading === false

-> Hide Loading


