24. COMMON PROBLEMS
================================================================================

PROBLEM: LOADING NEVER STOPS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Possible cause:

setIsLoading(false) is not reached after an error.


Solution:

finally {

  setIsLoading(false);

}


PROBLEM: LOADING DOES NOT APPEAR
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Check:

- Is setIsLoading(true) called before fetch()?
- Is loading UI using isLoading?
- Does the request complete so fast that the indicator is barely visible?


PROBLEM: LOADING AND BOOKS DISPLAY TOGETHER
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Use:

!isLoading && books.length > 0


PROBLEM: ERROR AND LOADING DISPLAY TOGETHER
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Use mutually clear conditions:

isLoading

!isLoading && error


PROBLEM: SEARCH CAN BE CLICKED REPEATEDLY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Disable the button:

disabled={isLoading}


